- Use English for all commit messages, code comments, function documentation, and technical documentation

- Never write forwarding functions (they add call overhead for no benefit). Expose the _core implementation directly as the public function.- Values of type ID must never be cast. No casts (ID) or (CljObject*) are needed: pass values as ID and use macros (e.g. RELEASE, RETAIN) or APIs that accept ID so no cast is needed at the call site.
